 "template": "In Odoo, open the Sales app and go to the existing draft quotation {{v1}} (customer \"{{v2}}\"). It has two order lines: line 1 is \"{{v4}}\" with quantity 3, line 2 is \"{{v6}}\" with quantity 2. Change ONLY the first line quantity from 3 to 5 (leave the second line at quantity 2). Save the quotation but do NOT confirm it. Then report: (a) the quantity shown on each of the two lines after the change, and (b) the new Untaxed Amount the app computes in the totals, plus the quotation reference and status shown. Note: the app long-polls, so never wait for network idle; wait for concrete page state instead.",
